  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wellbeing grant under DEC MEHA Duty of Care Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To safeguard the wellbeing of CFTA staff and volunteers in Gaza through a &#xa3;30,700 DEC Duty of Care grant. The project funds psychosocial support activities (recreation, reflection) and provides flexible financial assistance for displacement-related hardships, including shelter, transport, and essential family needs. This ensures staff have the resilience and resources to sustain their frontline humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
